    {
      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "I was only focusing on the weights, but I should also consider the memory space used for activations. Since the activations in BitNet B1.58 are 8-bit, the memory savings for internal activations will be limited to 2x. The KV cache is also 8-bit, so the memory savings in that area should also be calculated as 2x.\nI would like the author to confirm my assumptions.",
      "created_at": "2024-10-20T05:33:03Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/microsoft/BitNet/issues/41#issuecomment-2424606916",
      "id": 2424606916,
